Package: CompFinanceR
Type: Package
Title: Computational Finance Tools in R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lech", "Grzelak", email = "lech.grzelak@example.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Repository", "Contributor", email = "contributor@example.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
    )
Description: A comprehensive R package for computational finance implementing a consistent
    spec-fit-predict interface inspired by tidymodels and hardhat principles. Provides tools for
    simulating stochastic processes (GBM, ABM, Heston, CIR, Merton, Bates), pricing options
    (European, Asian, Barrier, Digital, Forward Start), computing Greeks, and implementing
    hedging strategies. Uses modern functional programming with purrr (no for loops or apply),
    robust input validation with checkmate, and follows tidyverse design principles throughout.
